				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "22db39da-c414-4e97-8e91-41d665cf485b")
	)
	(text "J1 lands on the opener's wall-control terminals:\n   RED   - Security+ 2.0 serial data (about 12.7 V idle)\n   WHITE - ground\nD1 clamps transients on the line (15 V standoff).\nR4 is a weak bias that defines the line when idle.\nObstruction status comes from the serial protocol;\nthe black obstruction wire is not used."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 200.66 78.74 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "332495af-2f1c-4e8e-a069-839ee6c84df8")
	)
	(text "NOTES\n1. Firmware: ESPHome secplus_gdo (gdolib) with invert_uart = true; uart_tx_pin = GPIO22, uart_rx_pin = GPIO18.\n2. Both FET stages invert the signal; the firmware's UART inversion restores the logic sense.\n3. Q1's gate sees the RED line directly: use a part rated +/-20 V Vgs (do not substitute AO3400A, +/-12 V).\n4. Ordering data: Manufacturer / MPN / DigiKey PN symbol fields and c6gdo-bom.csv."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.86 157.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "3c422356-a789-4194-93cd-8bba9a48106e")
	)
	(text "RX - INVERTING LEVEL SHIFTER"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 116.84 96.52 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.778 1.778)
				(thickness 0.3556)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "45fd1b0d-f4c4-4a00-8ad4-d0a485e9a34f")
	)
	(text "RED high turns Q1 on and pulls ESP_RX low (inverted UART RX).\nR5 is required: gdolib does not enable the internal pull-up."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 116.84 143.51 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "4e29db56-4cba-4de5-8167-0ca4e29acbc6")
	)
	(text "WHITE"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 264.16 60.96 0)
